      "claim": "A parent reports that the age gate for under‑13 users is enforced by blocking direct messaging unless parental consent is given.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "users under the age of 13 will be able to communicate using the broadcast public chat. To use direct messaging within experiences, users under 13 will need parental consent"
    },
